    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "The 30th Anniversary of the Inauguration\nof International Flights.",
      "Wine List A\nCocktails\nManhattan\nMartini\nWhiskies\nJapanese\nScotch\nBourbon\nWines\nChampagne\nGin\nVodka\nBrandy\nBeer\n$ 1.50\n$ 1.50\n$ 1.50\n$ 4.00\n$ 1.50\n$ 1.50\n$ 1.50\n$ 0. 50\nJake (Hot or Cold) $ 0. 50\n· 360\n917-\n360\n^-*\u003e\n913\nE-N\n·\n360\n· 960\n·\n360\n· 360\n· 360\n· 120\n· 120\nDiet drink and diet sugar are available.\nWould you like to enjoy a drink? Please look over the Wine List\nand choose your favorite drink. The prices listed above are applied\nto the economy class. Soft drinks are served free of charge.\nThis menu cover has been reproduced from the commemorative menu card provided on\nthe first flight that flew across the Pacific (San Francisco - Honolulu) 30 years ago.\nTOKYO-SAN FRANCISCO\nFLT. TIME\n8HRS.\n45MIN.\ninner\nTournedos Japanese Sauce\nFried Potatoes\nButtered Green Peas\nSalad in Season\nFrench Dressing\nMarron Cream\nRoll and Butter\nCoffee Tea Green Tea\n#513-00\n# *\nPacific Morning Plate\nDanish Pastry\nFruit-Flavored Cheese\nCoffee Tea Green Tea\nJ-t-\n002 NRT / SFO\nPRINTED\nIN JAPAN"
    ],
